Description: The ewarsmx package provides climatic and epidemiological data for the implementation of EWARS-CSD for dengue in Mexico.
     [EWARS-CSD](https://tdr.who.int/newsroom/news/item/21-09-2023-early-warning-and-response-system-for-dengue-outbreaks-in-mexico) is short of Early Warning and Response System for climate-sensitive diseases (EWARS-csd).
